  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Fairy Zi Wei obtains heart blood Immortal Gu through treasure yellow heaven, she gives it to the Gu Immortal who cultivates inside Demon Judgment Board. He shouts that success has arrived, leaves the board amid blood light, fragrance, immortal music, and bloody petals, and Fang Zheng kneels calling him master. He says the blood path method he conceptualized his entire life finally has its core and foundation, and that after staying in Demon Judgment Board for hundreds of years it is time to leave. Narration names the current Demon Judgment Board Lord as Red Heart Traveler, a sole blood path cultivator whose closed cultivation research let Heavenly Court’s blood path stay far ahead of the five regions. Qin Ding Ling’s luck advice made Fang Zheng his nominal disciple so Red Heart Traveler could borrow Fang Zheng’s luck; their relationship is shallow, and without Fairy Zi Wei’s orders he would not have taken the disciple. He instructs Fang Zheng to take over as Demon Judgment Board Lord, leaving inheritance and past Board Lords’ cultivation experiences inside the board. Nine Spiritual Fairy gathers him under orders to go to Western Desert and find trouble with Fang clan. His luck appears like a sun or blood pill, round and perfect, read as emergence from closed cultivation to travel the world.",
      "chapters": [
        1886
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
