    },
    {
      "text": "Narration later calls him a Heavenly Court Gu Immortal and the previous Demon Judgment Board leader. During the fate war he came to Western Desert disguised as a blood path demonic immortal, drawing Western Desert righteous path attention and restraining hostile forces for Central Continent. Demon Immortal Qi Jue cannot catch him easily and reads him as a rank eight blood path Gu Immortal. In combat Red Heart Traveler’s blood red light and blooming blood red flowers feel warm and righteous rather than evil. With Nine Spiritual Fairy he escapes Qi Jue, and he had been searching for a Blood Sea true inheritance exposed by the qi tide.",
      "chapters": [
        2014
